  "slug": "mango-mousse",
  "name": "Mango Mousse",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This mango mousse recipe is made with two simple ingredients: heavy whipping cream and mangoes. Top each serving with chopped mangoes for extra color!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Beat cream in a glass or metal bowl until stiff peaks form. Lift your beater or whisk straight up: the whipped cream will form sharp peaks."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Fold mango pur\u00e9e into whipped cream. Scoop mango mousse into serving glasses and chill until set, about 3 hours."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
